### Sample requests - open in IntelliJ (HTTP Client) or VS Code (REST Client extension).
### Change the dates if you like; lossDate must not be in the future.

### 1. Small, clean claim -> FAST_TRACK
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-1001",
  "claimantName": "Asha Menon",
  "lossType": "COLLISION",
  "lossDate": "2026-10-03",
  "claimedAmount": 1200,
  "description": "Minor fender bender in a mall parking lot, scratched rear bumper. Other driver exchanged details."
}

### 2. Suspicious theft (late report, frequent claimant, red-flag phrases) -> SPECIAL_INVESTIGATIONS
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-1006",
  "claimantName": "Meera Krishnan",
  "lossType": "THEFT",
  "lossDate": "2026-08-28",
  "claimedAmount": 22000,
  "description": "Car was stolen from my friend's garage while I was travelling. There is no police report filed yet."
}

### 3. Injury -> SENIOR_ADJUSTER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-1001",
  "claimantName": "Asha Menon",
  "lossType": "COLLISION",
  "lossDate": "2026-10-04",
  "claimedAmount": 3900,
  "description": "Hit a two-wheeler at a junction. The rider was injured and taken to hospital by ambulance."
}

### 4. Lapsed policy -> DENIAL_REVIEW
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-1003",
  "claimantName": "Daniel Joseph",
  "lossType": "COLLISION",
  "lossDate": "2026-10-03",
  "claimedAmount": 2000,
  "description": "Dent on the rear door after another car reversed into mine."
}

### Get a claim with its latest decision (ids 1-2 are seeded history, so request 3 above is claim 5)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/claims/5

### Audit trail - every tool call the agent made
GET http://localhost:8080/api/claims/5/trace

### All decisions for a claim (agent + human)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/claims/5/decisions

### Work queue: everything waiting for an adjuster
GET http://localhost:8080/api/claims?status=PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW

### Work queue: Special Investigations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/claims?queue=SPECIAL_INVESTIGATIONS

### Adjuster review (confirm or override the agent)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims/5/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "queue": "SENIOR_ADJUSTER",
  "reviewer": "adjuster.ravi",
  "notes": "Agree - bodily injury, needs senior handling."
}

### Run the labelled eval set (18 claims) through agent + guardrails
POST http://localhost:8080/api/eval/run

### How often adjusters agreed with the agent
GET http://localhost:8080/api/eval/review-agreement

### Policies
GET http://localhost:8080/api/policies
